# Shell scripts must check out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic. tools/fixtures/query-filters/render-surface.sh runs inside WSL
# against the wp-litespeed env; with CRLF the trailing \r rides into the sed
# pattern that resolves the OpenLiteSpeed vhost, the match fails, and the script
# aborts with "no vhost for site 'testbed'" — which reads as broken
# infrastructure rather than a line-ending problem. Cost one wrong diagnosis
# already.
*.sh text eol=lf
